ABLATION — the same trained policy with the risk channel forced to 0
====================================================================================================
policy                      reward success   lost critLo   reloc   preem   react    prot    sla  latency    energy
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
mappo (real risk)            22.58   0.731    9.9    3.4    52.5    50.6     1.9    10.9    1.6    278.5    2143.1
mappo (risk=0)               21.61   0.722   10.8    4.2    51.8    49.8     2.0     8.8    1.1    279.6    2103.1
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  CAVEAT: zeroing risk changes THREE things at once — the policy's input, the exposure term of the reward, and the destination selector's score. The reward columns are therefore not directly comparable; read `prot`, `lost` and `reloc`, which are physical outcomes.
  protected before failure: 10.88 -> 8.75
  tasks lost              : 9.88 -> 10.75
  relocations             : 52.50 -> 51.75

